{
  "bodyHash": "d8HybF5IkjI=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>水产养殖2 <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em>(1.14.4+)</em></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>仅兼容 NeoForge（1.20.4 之前仅兼容 Minecraft Forge）</em></span></p><p>水产养殖2扩展了《我的世界》的钓鱼系统，新增了30多种鱼类，可以通过钓鱼竿（任何模组或原版钓鱼竿均可！）钓获，或是在野外发现它们游动<span style=\"font-size:10px\">。</span> 同时，它还添加了一系列新钓鱼竿，可以装备鱼钩和鱼饵以获得额外功能。定制的钓鱼线和浮标也能让您的钓鱼竿独一无二。修饰器和定制物品可以在钓具箱中应用，该箱子还可以存放额外的鱼钩、鱼饵、钓鱼线和浮标。<br>\n每种生物群系类型——甚至包括模组生物群系——都有新种类的鱼类，它们将为您的钓鱼体验和世界增添活力，鱼群会在河流、池塘和海洋中游动！捕捞到的鱼类可以制成鱼片，鱼片的数量取决于鱼的种类 <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>（如果配置选项开启，则取决于重量）</em></span>。此外，您还有机会在钓鱼时获得闪亮的新战利品！（包括传说中的海神工具或护甲！ <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>（可配置）</em></span>）</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>更多文档请参见我们的维基百科。</em></a></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p><h3>可钓鱼类</h3><p><strong>淡水</strong><br>\n<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/smallmouth_bass.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>小口黑鲈<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/bluegill.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;蓝鳃太阳鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/brown_trout.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;褐鳟<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/carp.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;鲤鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/catfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;鲶鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/gar.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;雀鳝<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/minnow.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;米诺鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/muskellunge.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;北美狗鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/perch.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;河鲈</p><p><strong>干旱</strong><br>\n<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/bayad.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;巴亚德鲶<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/boulti.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>布提（尼罗罗非鱼）<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/capitaine.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;卡皮坦（尼罗河鲈）<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/synodontis.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;异齿鲶</p><p><strong>北冰洋</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_cod.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;大西洋鳕鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/blackfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;黑鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pacific_halibut.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;太平洋大比目鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_halibut.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;大西洋大比目鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_herring.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;大西洋鲱鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pink_salmon.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;粉红鲑 <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>（也可在河流中）<br></em></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pollock.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;黄线狭鳕<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/rainbow_trout.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>虹鳟</p><p><strong>海水</strong><br>\n<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/jellyfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;水母<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/red_grouper.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;红石斑鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tuna.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;金枪鱼</p><p><strong>丛林</strong><br>\n<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/arapaima.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;巨骨舌鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/arrau_turtle.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>阿劳龟<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/piranha.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;食人鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tambaqui.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;坦巴基鱼</p><p><strong>沼泽</strong><br>\n<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/AQ2-1.18.2/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/frog.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>青蛙 <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em>（自《我的世界》1.19版本起移除）</em></span></span><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/leech.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;水蛭<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/box_turtle.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;箱龟<br>\n<em>&amp; 淡水鱼</em></p><p><strong>蘑菇岛</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/red_shrooma.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;红色蘑菇鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/brown_shrooma.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;棕色蘑菇鱼<br>\n<em>&amp; 淡水鱼</em></p><p><strong>其他战利品</strong><br>\n<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/driftwood.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>漂流木<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tin_can.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>锡罐<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/goldfish.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>金鱼<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/message_in_a_bottle.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>瓶中信 [右键点击可揭示一条信息！]<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/algae.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>藻类（淡水生物群系）<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/box.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>盒子<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/lockbox.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>上锁的盒子<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/treasure_chest.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>宝藏箱<br></span>\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_5b8066e6-2213-4384-bd51-f1a9ebc43885.png\" alt=\"image\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>海神的恩赐</span></p><h2><strong>合成配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_7cd9898d-34ac-41cf-bc0a-83f164936de2.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_f4cea8f5-8a94-4faf-ac50-545b226ca22a.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_6bc91821-7595-4bd9-ad44-d74559bb46e4.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_ae62d924-8a4d-4e23-8b04-31f06095fde7.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_b8273603-600f-4de3-bc49-1668e832b3f8.png\" alt=\"image\"></p><h2>**截图</h2><p>**</p><h2><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WcjgaH5.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h2><h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_010ee9bb-373a-4eae-95d2-dfc006a5ac32.png\" alt=\"image\"></strong></h2><h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Pee4rVN.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>水产养殖1 <span style=\"font-size:8px\">(1.12.2及更早版本)</span></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><h2><strong>水产养殖</strong></h2><h2><strong>简介</strong></h2><p>水产养殖是对Minecraft基础钓鱼系统的扩展。它允许您用全新的系列钓竿和工具捕获超过30种新鱼类。每个生物群系都有新型鱼类，具有随机重量，可制成鱼片和食物，还有闪亮的新战利品等着您在钓鱼时发现！（包括传说中的海神工具或盔甲！）<br>&nbsp;</p><p>要开始您的水产养殖之旅，您需要制作一把铁质、金质或钻石钓竿（见下文。）</p><h2><strong>可钓物种</strong></h2><p><strong>淡水</strong>（森林、平原、峭壁）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vy8Fg.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/vy8Fg.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 蓝鳃太阳鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hfmXq.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/hfmXq.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲈鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fBPF4.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/fBPF4.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 河鲈<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hf9TK.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/hf9TK.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 褐鳟<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/STo9U.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/STo9U.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲶鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hi3x8.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hi3x8.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲤鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/olH26.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/olH26.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 北美狗鱼</p><p><strong>干旱</strong>（沙漠）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lDQoL0K.png\">&nbsp;尼罗鲈鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I26Avrc.png\">&nbsp;尼罗罗非鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R5QHHFq.png\">&nbsp;鲿科鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dgwY14b.png\">&nbsp;歧须鲶</p><p><strong>极寒</strong>（冻原、针叶林）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4GcZL.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/4GcZL.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鳕鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9s2ltlX.png\">&nbsp;青鳕<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qVDga8e.png\">&nbsp;鲱鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mrSz9ij.png\">&nbsp;大比目鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sCzdERo.png\">&nbsp;粉红鲑<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjDhV.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjDhV.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 虹鳟<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AV269o8.png\" width=\"17\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑鱼</p><p><strong>咸水</strong>（海滩、海洋）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BXImf.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/BXImf.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲑鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eFpIp.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/eFpIp.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 金枪鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rVr2e.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/rVr2e.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 红石斑鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jw13H.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jw13H.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 旗鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p489Z.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/p489Z.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲨鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9G69.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9G69.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲸鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VoalDkJ.png\">&nbsp;鱿鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QBYqKg0.png\">&nbsp;河豚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O7O4Yhn.png\">&nbsp;水母</p><p><strong>热带</strong>（丛林）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VxAbR5Z.png\">&nbsp;巨骨舌鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZJfauHY.png\">&nbsp;食人鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZBq8t3r.png\">&nbsp;大盖巨脂鲤<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1W9PXAS.png\"> 电鳗</p><p><strong>咸淡水</strong>（沼泽）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g0poZkE.png\">&nbsp;青蛙<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lBdrN6N.png\">&nbsp;乌龟<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tyWN6yW.png\">&nbsp;水蛭<br><em>以及淡水鱼</em></p><p><strong>蘑菇</strong>（蘑菇岛）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJKDC.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJKDC.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 红蘑菇鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/udpV8.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/udpV8.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 棕蘑菇鱼<br><em>以及淡水鱼</em></p><p><strong>所有生物群系<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aCuEOwi.png\">&nbsp;金鱼</p><p><strong>随机战利品<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b4g5G3X.png\">&nbsp;藻类（淡水生物群系）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mXcrvNX.png\">&nbsp;海草（咸水生物群系）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k55j8Ce.png\">&nbsp;木棍<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/muk8uoO.png\">浮木 [可合成木板！]<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vHoSvD1.png\">&nbsp;皮革靴子<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EFfLBqW.png\">&nbsp;锡罐<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8upC4TT.png\">&nbsp;骨头<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S2meWvo.png\">&nbsp;瓶中信 [右键点击获取信息！]<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/czINLcQ.png\">&nbsp;盒子<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XdbpBOV.png\">&nbsp;锁箱<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Rhw4Kb.png\">&nbsp;宝箱<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qp9VJRT.png\">&nbsp;海神宝箱（？！）<br><br></p><p>注意：如果您使用的模组添加了新生物群系，或者在无特定鱼类的生物群系中钓鱼，将默认钓到淡水鱼。</p><h2><strong>合成配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rD02ZQ8.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d1CPhaD.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/so1cDZT.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uNoAFwR.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a1PqJ01.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LmSyklA.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HSw5Nk9.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dRYEhhO.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wXoxO0H.png\" width=\"456\" height=\"256\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tlqIbKH.png\"></p><h2><strong>附魔</strong></h2><p>诱鱼 - 钓得更多鱼类<br>磁力 - 钓得更多战利品<br>远投 - 钓竿投掷更远<br>近投 - 钓竿投掷更近<br>双钩 - 有几率一次钓起两条鱼<br>倒钩 - 收钩窗口期更长<br>重线 - 钓到高重量鱼的几率更高</p><h2><strong>截图</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hm36i.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hm36i.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"514\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBksh.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBksh.png\" width=\"872\" height=\"520\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a7shC.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/a7shC.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"504\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wj8ro.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/wj8ro.png\" width=\"892\" height=\"544\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qETDITO.png\"></p></div><h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a><br></strong></span><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofoll